WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.207
Week 15: Health, Body, and Emergencies. describe symptoms understand basic medical questions request urgent help

2
00:00:08.207 --> 00:00:15.988
Form and meaning. Doler and sentirse; body parts with definite articles; hace + time; emergency commands.

3
00:00:15.988 --> 00:00:38.662
Model set. Me duele mucho la cabeza. Tengo fiebre desde ayer. ¿Es alérgico a algún medicamento? Llame a una ambulancia. Se cayó y se lastimó el brazo. My head hurts a lot. I have had a fever since yesterday. Are you allergic to any medication? Call an ambulance. He or she fell and hurt an arm.

4
00:00:38.662 --> 00:00:48.792
Contrastive practice. Change the person, time, number, or level of formality in each model. Preserve the communicative purpose while the grammar changes.

5
00:00:48.792 --> 00:01:01.482
Production check. Say one original sentence for each function: describe symptoms; understand basic medical questions; request urgent help. Then write it and compare the spoken and written forms.

6
00:01:01.482 --> 00:01:24.945
Model language. Me duele mucho la cabeza. — My head hurts a lot. Tengo fiebre desde ayer. — I have had a fever since yesterday. ¿Es alérgico a algún medicamento? — Are you allergic to any medication? Llame a una ambulancia. — Call an ambulance. Se cayó y se lastimó el brazo. — He or she fell and hurt an arm.

7
00:01:24.945 --> 00:01:34.694
Check your readiness. Explain the core idea. Produce an original example. Complete the section assessment at 85% or higher.
